<title>FINLAND: Nokia Q1 report due Apr 29 about 1200.</title>
<headline>Nokia Q1 report due Apr 29 about 1200.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish telecommunications group Nokia Oy said in a statement on Thursday it would report its first-quarter 1997 financial results on Tuesday April 29 at about 12:00 local time/0900 GMT.</p>
<p>--Helsinki Newsroom +358-9-680 50 235</p>
</text>
